+     $$ c_3 = \lfloor \frac{5 c_0 + 2 c_1}{7} \rfloor $$
+     $$ c_4 = \lfloor \frac{4 c_0 + 3 c_1}{7} \rfloor $$
+     $$ c_5 = \lfloor \frac{3 c_0 + 4 c_1}{7} \rfloor $$
